					</ul>

					<div class="listed__act">
						<a class="btn btn--flame" href="mailto:hello@hellogta.ca?subject=Placement%20enquiry"
							>Ask about your neighbourhood</a
						>
						<p>
							Tell us the area. If it is taken we will say so on the same day rather than put you on a
							list.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<figure class="listed__art">
					<img
						src={img("1590650153855-d9e808231d41", 620, 760)}
						srcset={img2x("1590650153855-d9e808231d41", 620, 760)}
						width="620"
						height="760"
						alt="An agent standing at a laptop in a bright office"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
					<figcaption>
						<strong>Why it is only {PLACEMENT.perArea} per area.</strong>
						A directory that lists everybody is a phone book, and nobody pays to be in a phone book.
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- --------------------------------------------------------- Big close -->
		<section class="close">
			<img
				class="close__bg"
				src={img("1517935706615-2717063c2225", 1600, 900)}
				width="1600"
				height="900"
				alt=""
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
			/>
			<div class="close__inner">
				<p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">
					<span class="eyebrow__pip" aria-hidden="true"></span>{DISPATCH.name}
				</p>
				<h2>Sunday, 7am. Then it leaves you alone for a week.</h2>
				<p>
					What sold and for how much, where rates landed, the open houses worth the trip, and one
