		/* --- Get listed ------------------------------------------------------
		   The offer band is the warmest thing on the page, not the darkest. An ink
		   panel here would run straight into the ink closing CTA below it and the
		   two would read as one long dark basement. Butter keeps the page bright
		   and leaves the single dark moment at the end, where the ask is.
		     ink on butter        15.4:1
		     muted on butter       5.0:1
		     flame-dk on butter    4.4:1  */
		.listed {
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fdf3e2 0%, #fbe9cd 100%);
			color: var(--ink);
			border-block: 1px solid #f2e0bf;
